---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import headshot from '../assets/headshot.jpg';
---

<Base title="About" description="About Prashanth Sampathkumar.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="about-grid">
    <Image class="portrait" src={headshot} width={440} alt="Prashanth Sampathkumar" />
    <div class="prose">
      <!-- TODO: placeholder copy. Rewrite in your own voice. -->
      <p>
        Ahhhhh I guess if you've come this far I can tell you what I'm up to G. I've been growing as a web developer and AI engineer after completing my bachelors in computer science at the
        University of Georgia. I have spent my career exploring different industries to understand the practical use of technology per industry. So far I have worked within benefits
        administration, FinTech, SAAS consulting, and health-care systems.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of work I helped start a small construction supply business, which is
        where most of the tools on this site came from. Somebody had to build
        them.
      </p>
      <p>
        The games section is honestly just pure endorphines. I grew up on the classics and I am
        rebuilding them from memory to understand how they actually work (now that I can).
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
